  "Solution": "Using the point-to-line distance formula, the distance \\(d\\) from the origin \\((0,0)\\) to the line is\n\\[\nd=\\frac{|3(0)+4(0)-10|}{\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}}.\n\\]\nThe numerator is 10, the denominator is 5, and the distance is 2.",
